+def prod_body_rig_leaf_admission(D, controlless, by_dest, constraints):
+    """Stage 2: which control-less bones are simulated leaves. Pure. Returns (admitted names sorted, refusals
+    {bone: reason}). Each must be one source-less transform channel per attribute; declared STUDIO_PROC_JIGGLE with
+    BONE_ALWAYS_PROCEDURAL and none of the physics or screen-align flags, by a header that matches the scene skeleton
+    exactly by index, name and parent; a leaf in the scene and in the header; under a bone that is not itself
+    control-less; and read by no concrete consumer: a header attachment or bone flex driver, a rig constraint (target
+    or pole) or a channel of the instance. Harmless relationships (hitbox use, a non-bone element parented below it)
+    do not refuse."""
